WEBVTT

00:02:28.716 --> 00:02:30.596
And what was the survey context?

00:02:30.596 --> 00:02:34.236
Hopefully, with those three questions
and a little bit of skepticism,

00:02:34.236 --> 00:02:37.076
you will be able to understand
when the data is legit

00:02:37.116 --> 00:02:38.636
and when it's irrelevant.

00:02:38.676 --> 00:02:40.076
Nine out of 10 Monas agree.

00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:41.396
[*No such survey
took place]